          H3("Option 2: Product or value-stream teams"),
          "Long-lived, cross-functional teams are aligned to a product, customer journey or value stream, and funding follows them. Expertise is kept through communities of practice. Most of the end-to-end benefit comes from here. Use [value stream mapping](/project-management/kanban/value-stream-mapping/) to find sensible boundaries.",
          H3("Option 3: A network model"),
